---
import config from '../data/config.json';
---

<section class="philosophy-section" id="philosophy" aria-labelledby="philosophy-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal-on-scroll">
      <div class="badge-pill">Methodology &amp; Framework</div>
      <h2 id="philosophy-heading" class="section-title">
        The Signature Pattern Framework
      </h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Success in the markets does not require knowing everything. It requires knowing one repeatable edge intimately, executing it with mathematical precision, and refusing to compromise on risk.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4-Stage Horizontal / Grid Progression -->
    <div class="framework-grid">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="framework-card reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="step-badge">Stage 01</div>
        <div class="card-icon-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
            <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
            <line x1="11" y1="8" x2="11" y2="14"></line>
            <line x1="8" y1="11" x2="14" y2="11"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="framework-card-title">Structural Pattern Recognition</h3>
        <p class="framework-card-desc">
          We identify institutional footprints where price, volume contraction, and business catalysts converge. Over 90% of intraday noise is discarded to isolate only high-probability inflection pivots.
        </p>
        <ul class="framework-subpoints">
          <li>Base consolidation &amp; volatility contraction</li>
          <li>Relative strength vs Nifty 50 benchmarks</li>
          <li>Institutional accumulation volume confirmation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="framework-card reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="step-badge">Stage 02</div>
        <div class="card-icon-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
            <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
            <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
            <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
            <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="framework-card-title">The Pedagogical Rule Set</h3>
        <p class="framework-card-desc">
          Like a lesson plan in a classroom, every trade idea comes with an exact blueprint: defined entry trigger, invalidation stop-loss, and capital allocation ceiling. Zero guesswork allowed.
        </p>
        <ul class="framework-subpoints">
          <li>Pre-calculated risk percentage per trade (max 1–2%)</li>
          <li>Explicit invalidation criteria (technical &amp; event-based)</li>
          <li>Written rationale shared with subscriber desk</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="framework-card reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="step-badge">Stage 03</div>
        <div class="card-icon-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="23 4 23 10 17 10"></polyline>
            <polyline points="1 20 1 14 7 14"></polyline>
            <path d="M3.51 9a9 9 0 0 1 14.85-3.36L23 10M1 14l4.64 4.36A9 9 0 0 0 20.49 15"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="framework-card-title">Relentless Execution Repetition</h3>
        <p class="framework-card-desc">
          An edge is only valuable if it is repeated without psychological wavering. By taking the identical setup through varying market cycles, emotional hesitation is eliminated completely.
        </p>
        <ul class="framework-subpoints">
          <li>Execution discipline regardless of market sentiment</li>
          <li>Systematic journaling of outcomes and deviations</li>
          <li>Preserving emotional capital through mechanical habits</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="framework-card reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="step-badge">Stage 04</div>
        <div class="card-icon-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="framework-card-title">Your Signature Compounding</h3>
        <p class="framework-card-desc">
          When the cycle completes, your results stop mirroring market chaos and begin mirroring your disciplined signature: small losses, multi-R winners, and stress-free long-term compounding.
        </p>
        <ul class="framework-subpoints">
          <li>Asymmetric payoff ratios (1:3+ minimum target targets)</li>
          <li>Strict risk containment during broader market drawdowns</li>
          <li>Sustainable capital compounding without lifestyle burn</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Matrix: The Student vs The Master -->
    <div class="matrix-card reveal-on-scroll">
      <h3 class="matrix-title">How Our Systematic Research Compares</h3>
      <div class="table-responsive" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Systematic Framework Comparison Table">
        <table>
          <caption>Comparison: Unstructured Retail Trading vs Ramesh Pal Systematic Research</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Evaluation Factor</th>
              <th scope="col">Emotional Retail Trading</th>
              <th scope="col">Ramesh Pal Signature Research</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Entry Strategy</th>
              <td>News headlines, FOMO breakouts, Telegram tips</td>
              <td><strong>Pre-screened structural pattern with volume confirmation</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Risk Management</th>
              <td>Undefined stop-losses, averaging down losing positions</td>
              <td><strong>Strict 1–2% portfolio risk limit; zero averaging down</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Execution Process</th>
              <td>Impulsive, random, dependent on daily mood</td>
              <td><strong>Mechanical, repeatable syllabus followed without exception</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Market Volatility</th>
              <td>Panic selling at bottoms, euphoria buying at tops</td>
              <td><strong>Calm adherence to predefined invalidation stops</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Regulatory Compliance</th>
              <td>Unregistered tip channels, conflict of interest</td>
              <td><strong>SEBI-Registered Research Analyst (Reg. {config.sebiRegNo})</strong></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .philosophy-section {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
  }

  .section-head {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto 64px auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
    margin: 16px 0 20px 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .section-lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .framework-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .framework-card {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 28px 24px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .framework-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    border-color: var(--accent-border);
  }

  .step-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: monospace;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .card-icon-wrap {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .framework-card-title {
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .framework-card-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .framework-subpoints {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    padding-top: 16px;
  }

  .framework-subpoints li {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 14px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .framework-subpoints li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  /* Comparison Matrix */
  .matrix-card {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 36px 32px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .matrix-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .framework-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .framework-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .matrix-card {
      padding: 24px 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
